<mxCell id="lg_c" value="1-7 claim steps. One least-privilege IAM role per Lambda. Only the Decision Lambda writes AUTO_APPROVED or ROUTED_TO_ADJUSTER; the agent is read-only. Tool calls: IAM auth plus a KMS-signed ticket for one claim; user tokens stop at API Gateway. Not drawn (pilot): VPC endpoints, WAF, Fargate worker, CloudWatch Omni." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="165" y="692" width="910" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
